":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Change\r\n\r\nFixes #130.\r\n\r\nBoth real-corpus tests now use the same test-only publication fixture loader, matching the existing Git `export-ignore` selection. All contributor documentation remains intact; all original parser assertions, runtime files, production code, archive limits and memory settings are preserved.\r\n\r\nThe loader rejects Git failures and excluded manifest dependencies before reading the corpus. Five regressions cover nested contributor exclusions, tracked/untracked publication files (including unmanifested additions), all nine manifest path maps, excluded manifests, failed Git enumeration and NUL-delimited Unicode/space/newline/tab paths.\r\n\r\n## Independent reviews and reconciliation\r\n\r\n- Independent plan review: implementable. Reconciled NUL-delimiter coverage, all manifest namespaces and unmanifested untracked bytes before implementation; owner record: https://github.com/stop-cran/kanji-cards-android/issues/130#issuecomment-6684766932.\r\n- Independent final code review: no significant issues found. Reviewer inspected all five changed/new files and saved XML; did not rerun tests. Both reviewers' exact model identifiers were unavailable.\r\n\r\n## Validation\r\n\r\n- Fresh five loader regressions + three RealContent tests + one RareHan test: PASS, no failures/errors/skips, `41 actionable tasks: 41 executed`, unchanged qualified HOST-only2GiB init. Tested against complete content snapshot b9eb2fb52b6619c1810cc68e5da3ebbcddd6175b.\r\n- Full standard-heap `-PcoreOnly :core:check`: PASS,9m47s, no heap override.\r\n- `lintDebug :core:verifyJvmBoundary`: PASS.\r\n- Initial `detekt` run reproduced two pre-existing `ComposeUiTest` findings, also present in baseline main CI https://github.com/stop-cran/kanji-cards-android/actions/runs/41849632967. Following explicit authorization to unblock #130, six existing page/feedback tests were moved unchanged into `PageChromeTest`, and one long string literal was split without changing its value. All27 original test method bodies were mechanically compared (normalizing CRLF and that adjacent literal split).\r\n- Final `detekt`, `lintDebug`, and both affected UI test classes PASS:21ComposeUiTest+6PageChromeTest, zero failures/errors/skips. No rule suppressions, baseline changes or production edits.\r\n- No emulator or physical-phone test: test-source/documentation changes only, no production/UI changes.\r\n\r\nN1 batch082 resumes only after actual green CI, normal signed integration and verified compatible test-only baseline adoption; this PR does not claim native/phone/whole-rollout acceptance.\r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-06T12:44:25Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T13:19:37Z","closed_at":"2026-11-06T13:19:37Z","merged_at":"2026-11-06T13:19:37Z","merge_commit_sha":"e46106de88892b6886f38199b5ca20f2134b27f6","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"stop-cran:fix/publishable-content-test-loader","ref":"fix/publishable-content-test-loader","repo":{"id":1410189605,"node_id":"R_kgDOVA3JJQ","name":"kanji-cards-android","full_name":"stop-cran/kanji-cards-android","owner":{"login":"stop-cran","id":19759705,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NzU5NzA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19759705?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/stop-cran","html_url":"https://github.com/stop-cran","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stop-cran/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stop-cran/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stop-cran/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stop-cran/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stop-cran/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stop-cran/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/stop-cran/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com